"This replaces your current edits for %@ with the selected version, or deletes the file if that version removed it." = "此操作會將 %@ 的目前編輯取代為所選版本。如果該版本已刪除此檔案，則會刪除該檔案。";
"Git will return this worktree to its pre-merge state. Conflict-resolution edits will be discarded. Source branch commits are kept." = "Git 會將此工作樹還原到合併前的狀態。解決衝突時的編輯會被捨棄，來源分支的提交會保留。";
"Open File" = "打開檔案";
"Mark Resolved" = "標記已解決";
"Keep Version" = "保留版本";
"Use Target Version" = "使用目標分支版本";
"Use Incoming Version" = "使用待合併分支版本";
"Delete File" = "刪除檔案";
"File Deleted in This Version" = "此版本已刪除該檔案";
"Binary File — Open Externally" = "二進位檔案，請在外部打開";
"Git returned invalid merge information." = "Git 傳回了無效的合併資訊。";
"There is no active merge for this file or worktree. Refresh and try again." = "此檔案或工作樹沒有進行中的合併。請重新整理後再試。";
"Remove the conflict markers before marking this file as resolved." = "請先移除衝突標記，再將此檔案標記為已解決。";
"Resolve all conflicts and stage your changes before continuing the merge." = "請先解決所有衝突並暫存修改，再繼續合併。";
"Finish requires a linked worktree with a local branch." = "完成操作需要關聯到本機分支的工作樹。";
"Choose a different target branch." = "請選擇其他目標分支。";
"Open the target branch in another worktree before finishing." = "請先在另一個工作樹中打開目標分支，再完成操作。";
"The branch or commit changed. Refresh the merge preview before continuing." = "分支或提交已變更。請重新整理合併預覽後再繼續。";
"The worktree is locked, missing, or its branch is still checked out. Keep it or unlock it before cleanup." = "工作樹已鎖定、目錄遺失，或分支仍被簽出。請保留它，或解鎖後再清理。";
"The target branch does not contain all source commits. The worktree and branch were kept." = "目標分支尚未包含全部來源提交。工作樹和分支已保留。";
"Finish the existing merge, rebase, or cherry-pick before starting another merge." = "請先完成目前合併、重定基底或挑選操作，再開始新的合併。";
"Commit or stash changes in %@ before merging." = "請先提交或儲藏 %@ 中的修改，再進行合併。";

"Worktrees" = "工作樹";

/* Worktree enablement */
"Enable Worktrees" = "啟用工作樹";
"Repository Worktrees" = "各儲存庫工作樹";
"After enabling worktrees globally, enable them for each repository in its context menu. Worktree information and management actions appear only for enabled repositories. Turning this off preserves repository choices." = "全域啟用後，透過儲存庫右鍵選單為各儲存庫啟用工作樹。只有啟用的儲存庫才顯示工作樹資訊和管理操作。關閉此開關會保留各儲存庫的選擇。";

"Search Author, Email, or Message" = "搜尋作者、電子郵件或提交訊息";

/* File change types in diff headers. */
"Added" = "新增";
"Modified" = "修改";
"Deleted" = "刪除";
"Renamed" = "重新命名";
"Copied" = "複製";
"File Mode Changed" = "檔案權限變更";
"Conflicted" = "衝突";
"Binary File" = "二進位檔案";
"Similarity: %@" = "相似度：%@";
"File Mode: %@ → %@" = "檔案權限：%@ → %@";
